      "text": "[7:30p.m.] #AirportRoad #AjaoEstate #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is good moving in from Oshodi to Charity, Ajao Estate, NAHCO and back to 7 & 8, Ajao Estate, Fatai irawo and Awoniyi Elemo junctions, Lateef Salami Street connecting Asa Afariogun Street inward Eleganza Roundabout, approaching Chivita, Canoe towards NNPC junction is all good. \n\n@Sola_Giwa\n@gm_lastma\n@followlasg\n@GoldmyneTV\n@Mr_JAGs\n@gbenga_omo\n@TrafficChiefNG\n@channelstv\n@lagosMOT1\n@lagostraffic961\n@daily_trust\n@thecableng\n@walemusa\n@seunosiyemi_\n@vanguardngrnews\n@MobilePunch\n@NigeriaNewsdesk\n@TheNationNews\n@channelstv\n@FRSCNigeria\n@OlalekanOki\n@rrslagos767\n@Gidi_Traffic",
